IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. BANK-SYSTEM.

DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.

01 BALANCE PIC 9(5)V99 VALUE 1000.00.
01 DEPOSIT PIC 9(5)V99 VALUE 250.00.
01 WITHDRAWAL PIC 9(5)V99 VALUE 300.00.
01 FINAL-BALANCE PIC 9(5)V99.

PROCEDURE DIVISION.

    DISPLAY "=== COBOL BANK SYSTEM ==="
    DISPLAY "INITIAL BALANCE: " BALANCE

    ADD DEPOSIT TO BALANCE GIVING BALANCE
    DISPLAY "AFTER DEPOSIT (+250): " BALANCE

    SUBTRACT WITHDRAWAL FROM BALANCE GIVING BALANCE
    DISPLAY "AFTER WITHDRAWAL (-300): " BALANCE

    MOVE BALANCE TO FINAL-BALANCE

    DISPLAY "FINAL BALANCE: " FINAL-BALANCE
    DISPLAY "TRANSACTION COMPLETE"

    STOP RUN.